  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>, be a <math><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math> matrix, such that <math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />Statement - I : <math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br />Statement - II : The polynomial <math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></math>,can be&nbsp;reduced to <math><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> Then :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "6R7z1",
      "text": "Both the statements are true",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "BoU0Z",
      "text": "Both the statements are false",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "OG4ly",
      "text": "Statement - I is true, but Statement - II is false",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "RYeYJ",
      "text": "Statement - I is false, but Statement - II is true",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />Hence, the statement I is true.<br /><br />Now&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;{from<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>}&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;{from<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>}</p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>I</mi></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, Statement II is true.</p>",
    "image": null
